# What is deployed is the page in `site/`, the mark in `assets/`, and the
# student-facing documents in `dist/`. Everything that makes those is left
# behind: the build, the gates and the notes pipeline have no business on a
# web host.
#
# A `.vercelignore` replaces `.gitignore` for the upload rather than adding to
# it, so anything that must stay off the host is named here even if git already
# ignores it. `dist/Instructor_Solutions.*` is the one that matters.

build/
notes/
verify/
tools/
docs/
source/
shots/
pages/
.venv/
node_modules/
.claude/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
*.md
textclash.json

# Instructor material is not published.
dist/Instructor_Solutions.*

# The three HTML editions duplicate the PDFs beside them and nothing links to
# them, so they are not carried.
dist/Lecture_Notes.html
dist/Student_Workbook.html
dist/Formula_Reference.html
